# Tests for the Estimated_payments module

Run with `clerk test`. Concrete cases of issue #25, plus rejected bad
outputs. Oracle comparison: `make difftest SCOPE=estimated_payments`.

> Using Estimated_payments as E

## Flag false: the amount is ignored

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFlagFalseIgnoresAmount:
  r scope E.EstimatedPayments

scope TestFlagFalseIgnoresAmount:
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals false
  definition r.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $500.00
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year = $0
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

## Flag true: $500.49 gives $500, and bad outputs are rejected

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestRoundsDown:
  r scope E.EstimatedPayments

scope TestRoundsDown:
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition r.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $500.49
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year = $500.00
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year != $500.49
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year != $0
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestRoundsHalfUp:
  r scope E.EstimatedPayments

scope TestRoundsHalfUp:
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition r.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $10.50
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year = $11.00
```

## Name change knockout

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestNameChangeKnockout:
  r scope E.EstimatedPayments
  r_not_paid scope E.EstimatedPayments

scope TestNameChangeKnockout:
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition r.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $500.00
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals true
  definition r.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  definition r_not_paid.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals false
  definition r_not_paid.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $0
  definition r_not_paid.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals true
  definition r_not_paid.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  assertion r.ko_knockout_paid_estimated_taxes_under_different_last_name
  assertion r.unsupported
  # the amount is still computed (conventions section 6, item 4)
  assertion r.estimated_and_from_last_year = $500.00
  # a "different name" answer is irrelevant when no payment was made
  assertion not r_not_paid.unsupported
```

## Former spouse

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFormerSpouse:
  tp scope E.EstimatedPayments
  sp scope E.EstimatedPayments
  both scope E.EstimatedPayments
  none scope E.EstimatedPayments

scope TestFormerSpouse:
  definition tp.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition tp.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $1.00
  definition tp.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition tp.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.TpDid
  definition sp.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition sp.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $1.00
  definition sp.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition sp.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.SpouseDid
  definition both.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition both.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $1.00
  definition both.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition both.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.BothDid
  definition none.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year equals true
  definition none.estimated_tax_payment_writable equals $1.00
  definition none.paid_estimated_taxes_or_from_last_year_under_different_name equals false
  definition none.paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse equals E.PaidWithFormerSpouse.Neither
  assertion tp.tp_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion not tp.spouse_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion sp.spouse_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion not sp.tp_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion both.tp_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion both.spouse_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion not none.some_tp_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion tp.some_tp_paid_estimated_taxes_with_former_spouse
  assertion not tp.unsupported
```
